      "title": "Freeze, execute, and independently sign off representative outcome admission",
      "class": "evaluation",
      "objective": "Produce a decision-ready, both-sign false-block and bypass evaluation for mandatory first-consumer outcome admission without silently expanding to cross-repository or fleet enforcement.",
